Upgrade vendored cJSON from 1.7.16 to 1.7.17

cJSON 1.7.16 can read past the end of a buffer in cJSON_SetValuestring when
the new string is longer than the old one (CVE-2023-50472). We link cJSON
for the STAT reply, so a long value could crash the server. 1.7.17 fixes the
length handling; the vendored copy is replaced file for file with the
upstream release.
